@@ -0,0 +1,38 @@
+aster-iwlwifi is a Rust port of parts of Linux's iwlwifi driver
+(drivers/net/wireless/intel/iwlwifi, Linux 6.18): the firmware file format,
+the PCIe transport and the MVM operation mode's command sequence, command
+layouts and constants. Linux licenses those files as
+"GPL-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause"; this port takes them under BSD-3-Clause. The
+port's own code is under the MPL-2.0, like the rest of this kernel.
